      "title": "🍇 Aglianico品种科学深度解析",
      "content": "<div class=\"\\&quot;intro-section\\&quot;\">\n    <h3>品种起源 &amp; 单宁之王</h3>\n    <p><strong>历史溯源：</strong>希腊<strong>Vitis hellenica</strong>演化 | 最早文献记录1520年代</p>\n    <p><strong>绝对优势：</strong>义大利单宁含量最高、陈年潜力最强的品种之一</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;characteristic-grid\\&quot;\">\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;char-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>🔬 单宁含量</h4>\n      <p>4500-6500</p>\n      <p style=\"\\&quot;font-size:0.9em;\\&quot;\">mg/L 🏆 意大利第1</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;char-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>⚗️ 酸度</h4>\n      <p>pH 3.2-3.4</p>\n      <p style=\"\\&quot;font-size:0.9em;\\&quot;\">极高酸度</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;char-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>🎨 花青素</h4>\n      <p>3800-5500</p>\n      <p style=\"\\&quot;font-size:0.9em;\\&quot;\">mg/L 深紫黑色</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;char-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>📅 成熟期</h4>\n      <p>10月中下旬</p>\n      <p style=\"\\&quot;font-size:0.9em;\\&quot;\">极晚熟</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;comparison-table\\&quot;\">\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>比较维度</th>\n          <th>Aglianico</th>\n          <th>Nebbiolo</th>\n          <th>Sangiovese</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>🌡️ 成熟期</td>\n          <td>10月中下旬 极晚</td>\n          <td>10月中旬 晚</td>\n          <td>9月下-10月初 中晚</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>💪 单宁结构</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-excellent\\&quot;\">4500-6500 mg/L 最强</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-excellent\\&quot;\">4000-5500 mg/L 强</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-good\\&quot;\">3000-4500 mg/L 中高</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>⚡ 酸度</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-excellent\\&quot;\">pH 3.2-3.4 极高</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-excellent\\&quot;\">pH 3.3-3.5 高</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-good\\&quot;\">pH 3.4-3.6 中高</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>🎨 颜色深度</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-excellent\\&quot;\">深紫黑色</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-moderate\\&quot;\">石榴红偏浅</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-good\\&quot;\">红宝石红</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>👃 核心风味</td>\n          <td>黑莓/紫罗兰/焦油/矿物</td>\n          <td>玫瑰/焦油/松露</td>\n          <td>樱桃/番茄叶/草本</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>⏳ 陈年潜力</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-excellent\\&quot;\">15-30年 极长</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-excellent\\&quot;\">20-40年 最长</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-good\\&quot;\">10-20年 长</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>🌍 核心产区</td>\n          <td>Vulture/Taurasi</td>\n          <td>Barolo/Barbaresco</td>\n          <td>Chianti/Montalcino</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>💰 价格区间</td>\n          <td>€20-100</td>\n          <td>€40-300+</td>\n          <td>€15-200+</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>📊 国际知名度</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-good\\&quot;\">★★★☆☆ 崛起中</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-excellent\\&quot;\">★★★★★ 顶级</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-excellent\\&quot;\">★★★★★ 顶级</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>🏆 性价比</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-excellent\\&quot;\">★★★★★ 最佳</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-moderate\\&quot;\">★★★☆☆ 较低</td>\n          <td class=\"\\&quot;rating-good\\&quot;\">★★★★☆ 高</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;aroma-section\\&quot;\">\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;aroma-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>🌸 紫罗兰香气</h4>\n      <p><strong>β-紫罗兰酮：</strong>4-8 μg/L</p>\n      <p>Aglianico标志性特征</p>\n      <p>陈年后转化为鸢尾花香</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;aroma-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>⛰️ 矿物感</h4>\n      <p><strong>硫醇类化合物</strong></p>\n      <p>火山岩带来的石墨感</p>\n      <p>湿石头、火药味</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;aroma-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>🛢️ 焦油特征</h4>\n      <p><strong>酚类物质演化</strong></p>\n      <p>单宁高度聚合产生</p>\n      <p>陈年后更明显</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;regional-comparison\\&quot;\">\n    <h3>🌍 Aglianico三大产区风格对比</h3>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;regional-grid\\&quot;\">\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;regional-item\\&quot;\" style=\"\\&quot;background:\" rgba(142,68,173,0.08);\\\"=\"\">\n        <h4>🌋 Vulture<br>(Basilicata)</h4>\n        <p><strong>土壤：</strong>100%火山土</p>\n        <p><strong>风格：</strong>最优雅、矿物感极致</p>\n        <p><strong>陈年：</strong>15-25年</p>\n        <p><strong>价格：</strong>€25-100</p>\n        <p><strong>特色：</strong>紫罗兰+火山石</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;regional-item\\&quot;\" style=\"\\&quot;background:\" rgba(230,126,34,0.08);\\\"=\"\">\n        <h4>🏔️ Taurasi<br>(Campania)</h4>\n        <p><strong>土壤：</strong>混合石灰岩+火山</p>\n        <p><strong>风格：</strong>最强劲、结构感</p>\n        <p><strong>陈年：</strong>20-30年</p>\n        <p><strong>价格：</strong>€40-150+</p>\n        <p><strong>特色：</strong>焦油+黑莓</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;regional-item\\&quot;\" style=\"\\&quot;background:\" rgba(52,152,219,0.08);\\\"=\"\">\n        <h4>⛰️ Taburno<br>(Campania)</h4>\n        <p><strong>土壤：</strong>石灰岩为主</p>\n        <p><strong>风格：</strong>果香明显、易饮</p>\n        <p><strong>陈年：</strong>10-15年</p>\n        <p><strong>价格：</strong>€15-35</p>\n        <p><strong>特色：</strong>黑樱桃+香料</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
    },
