      "type": "content",
      "title": "🌋 Monte Vulture火山风土科学",
      "content": "<div class=\"\\&quot;volcano-intro\\&quot;\">\n    <h3>死火山概览</h3>\n    <p>🔥 <strong>最后喷发：</strong>131,000年前 | 📏 <strong>海拔：</strong>1326m</p>\n    <p>💧 <strong>特征：</strong>Monticchio双湖（火山口湖）| 🏆 UNESCO地质公园候选</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;rocks-grid\\&quot;\">\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;rock-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>🪨 玄武岩</h4>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;percentage\\&quot;\">70%</div>\n      <p>主导岩石</p>\n      <p>富含铁、镁</p>\n      <p>极致矿物感</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;rock-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>🏔️ 火山凝灰岩</h4>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;percentage\\&quot;\">20%</div>\n      <p>压缩火山灰</p>\n      <p>排水性优异</p>\n      <p>保水能力</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;rock-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>🌫️ 火山灰</h4>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;percentage\\&quot;\">5%</div>\n      <p>细粒碎屑</p>\n      <p>高CEC</p>\n      <p>养分丰富</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;rock-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>💣 火山弹</h4>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;percentage\\&quot;\">&lt;5%</div>\n      <p>岩浆团块</p>\n      <p>表土散布</p>\n      <p>排水加强</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;soil-data-table\\&quot;\">\n    <h3>🧪 Andosol土壤实验室数据</h3>\n    <p style=\"\\&quot;text-align:\" center;=\"\" color:=\"\" #7f8c8d;=\"\" margin-bottom:=\"\" 15px;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 0.95em;\\\"=\"\">\n      数据来源：Università della Basilicata 2017\n    </p>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>化学成分</th>\n          <th>数值范围</th>\n          <th>全球对比</th>\n          <th>对葡萄酒影响</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>铁含量 Fe₂O₃</td>\n          <td style=\"\\&quot;font-weight:\" 700;=\"\" color:=\"\" #e74c3c;\\\"=\"\">12-18%</td>\n          <td>极高（全球均值4-8%）</td>\n          <td>矿物感、单宁结构、深色</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>pH值</td>\n          <td style=\"\\&quot;font-weight:\" 700;=\"\" color:=\"\" #27ae60;\\\"=\"\">5.5-6.5</td>\n          <td>微酸性理想值</td>\n          <td>维持高酸度、保鲜度</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>阳离子交换量 CEC</td>\n          <td style=\"\\&quot;font-weight:\" 700;=\"\" color:=\"\" #3498db;\\\"=\"\">35-50 cmol/kg</td>\n          <td>极高（全球均值10-25）</td>\n          <td>养分供应、风味复杂度</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>有机质</td>\n          <td style=\"\\&quot;font-weight:\" 700;\\\"=\"\">2.5-4.0%</td>\n          <td>中高</td>\n          <td>微生物活性、土壤生命力</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>排水性</td>\n          <td style=\"\\&quot;font-weight:\" 700;\\\"=\"\">优异</td>\n          <td>火山碎屑结构</td>\n          <td>根系深扎、抗病性</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;elevation-section\\&quot;\">\n    <h3>⛰️ 海拔分层：Vertical Terroir三区域</h3>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;elevation-table\\&quot;\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>海拔区间</th>\n            <th>温度特性</th>\n            <th>风格特征</th>\n            <th>陈年潜力</th>\n            <th>适饮期</th>\n            <th>顶级酒比例</th>\n            <th>代表酒庄</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td>低海拔<br>400-500m</td>\n            <td>较温暖<br>+2-3°C</td>\n            <td>更多果香、饱满<br>成熟度高</td>\n            <td>10-15年</td>\n            <td>3-8年</td>\n            <td>5%</td>\n            <td>入门级DOC</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;golden-zone\\&quot;\">🌟 中海拔<br>500-600m</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;golden-zone\\&quot;\">理想温度<br>日夜差15-20°C</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;golden-zone\\&quot;\">矿物感极致<br>平衡完美</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;golden-zone\\&quot;\">20-30年</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;golden-zone\\&quot;\">5-15年</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;golden-zone\\&quot;\">90%</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;golden-zone\\&quot;\">Elena Fucci<br>Paternoster<br>Cantine del Notaio</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>高海拔<br>600-700m</td>\n            <td>较凉爽<br>-2-3°C</td>\n            <td>极度优雅、精致<br>酸度更高</td>\n            <td>15-25年</td>\n            <td>8-18年</td>\n            <td>5%</td>\n            <td>实验性地块</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"\\&quot;text-align:\" center;=\"\" margin-top:=\"\" 15px;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 0.95em;=\"\" color:=\"\" #7f8c8d;\\\"=\"\">\n      ⭐ <strong>黄金区域：</strong>500-600m海拔段被称为\"Sweet Spot\"，90%的顶级DOCG来自这个区间\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;climate-box\\&quot;\">\n    <h3>🌤️ Vulture气候特性</h3>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;climate-grid\\&quot;\">\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;climate-item\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>🌡️ 年均温</h4>\n        <p>13-14°C</p>\n        <p style=\"\\&quot;font-size:\" 0.9em;=\"\" color:=\"\" #7f8c8d;\\\"=\"\">凉爽大陆性气候</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;climate-item\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>🌓 日夜温差</h4>\n        <p>15-20°C</p>\n        <p style=\"\\&quot;font-size:\" 0.9em;=\"\" color:=\"\" #7f8c8d;\\\"=\"\">保持酸度与芳香</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;climate-item\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>☔ 年降雨量</h4>\n        <p>700-900mm</p>\n        <p style=\"\\&quot;font-size:\" 0.9em;=\"\" color:=\"\" #7f8c8d;\\\"=\"\">充足但不过量</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
    },
