      "content": "<div class=\"\\&quot;villages-intro\\&quot;\">\n    <h3>🏘️ DOCG产区5大核心村庄</h3>\n    <p style=\"\\&quot;margin-bottom:\" 10px;\\\"=\"\">100% Aglianico品种，火山风土的精华区域</p>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;village-tags\\&quot;\">\n      <span class=\"\\&quot;village-tag\\&quot;\">Barile</span>\n      <span class=\"\\&quot;village-tag\\&quot;\">Rionero in Vulture</span>\n      <span class=\"\\&quot;village-tag\\&quot;\">Ripacandida</span>\n      <span class=\"\\&quot;village-tag\\&quot;\">Ginestra</span>\n      <span class=\"\\&quot;village-tag\\&quot;\">Venosa</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;comparison-section\\&quot;\">\n    <h3>🏆 DOCG vs DOC 法规10维度对比</h3>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;comparison-table\\&quot;\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>维度</th>\n            <th>Aglianico del Vulture DOCG</th>\n            <th>Aglianico del Vulture DOC</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td>📜 升级年份</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;highlight-yes\\&quot;\">2010年</td>\n            <td>1971年</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🍇 产量限制</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;highlight-yes\\&quot;\">65 hl/ha</td>\n            <td>70 hl/ha</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>⏳ 基础陈年</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;highlight-yes\\&quot;\">12个月</td>\n            <td>12个月</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>⭐ Superiore陈年</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;highlight-yes\\&quot;\">24个月（含12月橡木桶）</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;highlight-no\\&quot;\">无此等级</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🏅 Riserva陈年</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;highlight-yes\\&quot;\">36个月（含24月橡木桶）</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;highlight-no\\&quot;\">无此等级</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🔬 品质检验</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;highlight-yes\\&quot;\">强制官方盲品</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;highlight-no\\&quot;\">仅化学检测</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🌍 产区范围</td>\n            <td>5核心村庄精选地块</td>\n            <td>15村庄更大范围</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>💰 市场价格</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;highlight-yes\\&quot;\">€25-100+</td>\n            <td>€10-25</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>⚡ Parker评分</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;highlight-yes\\&quot;\">90-97分</td>\n            <td>85-90分</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>📊 年产量</td>\n            <td>~1.5M瓶（仅DOCG）</td>\n            <td>~4M瓶（总计）</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;comparison-section\\&quot;\">\n    <h3>⚔️ Vulture vs Taurasi 深度对比</h3>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;vulture-taurasi-table\\&quot;\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>维度</th>\n            <th>Vulture (Basilicata)</th>\n            <th>Taurasi (Campania)</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🌋 土壤类型</td>\n            <td>100%火山土</td>\n            <td>混合石灰岩+火山</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>⛰️ 海拔</td>\n            <td>400-700m</td>\n            <td>350-600m</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🍷 酿造风格</td>\n            <td>最优雅、矿物感极致</td>\n            <td>最强劲、结构感最强</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🎨 颜色深度</td>\n            <td>深紫黑色</td>\n            <td>深宝石红</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>💪 单宁结构</td>\n            <td>细腻、丝滑</td>\n            <td>强劲、紧实</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>👃 核心香气</td>\n            <td>紫罗兰+火山石+黑莓</td>\n            <td>焦油+黑樱桃+皮革</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>⏳ 陈年潜力</td>\n            <td>15-25年</td>\n            <td>20-30年</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🕐 适饮期</td>\n            <td>5-15年</td>\n            <td>8-20年</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>💰 价格区间</td>\n            <td>€25-100</td>\n            <td>€40-150+</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>📊 国际知名度</td>\n            <td>★★★☆☆ 崛起中</td>\n            <td>★★★★☆ 成熟</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🏆 性价比</td>\n            <td class=\"\\&quot;highlight-yes\\&quot;\">★★★★★ 最佳</td>\n            <td>★★★★☆ 较高</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🎯 推荐人群</td>\n            <td>追求优雅+性价比</td>\n            <td>追求强劲+陈年</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h3 0=\"\" style=\"\\&quot;color:\" #8e44ad;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 1.5em;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" center;=\"\" margin:=\"\" 30px=\"\" 20px=\"\" 0;\\\"=\"\">📜 Basilicata其他DOC产区</h3>\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;other-doc-grid\\&quot;\">\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;doc-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>Matera DOC</h4>\n      <p><strong>品种：</strong>Primitivo、Greco</p>\n      <p><strong>风格：</strong>果香浓郁、易饮</p>\n      <p><strong>价格：</strong>€8-18</p>\n      <p><strong>特色：</strong>配合Sassi旅游</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;doc-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>Grottino di<br>Roccanova DOC</h4>\n      <p><strong>品种：</strong>Sangiovese主导</p>\n      <p><strong>风格：</strong>传统、质朴</p>\n      <p><strong>价格：</strong>€6-12</p>\n      <p><strong>特色：</strong>本地消费为主</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;doc-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>Terre dell'Alta<br>Val d'Agri DOC</h4>\n      <p><strong>品种：</strong>多品种混酿</p>\n      <p><strong>风格：</strong>实验性</p>\n      <p><strong>价格：</strong>€7-15</p>\n      <p><strong>特色：</strong>山区微气候</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;doc-card\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>Basilicata IGT</h4>\n      <p><strong>品种：</strong>自由混酿</p>\n      <p><strong>风格：</strong>多样化</p>\n      <p><strong>价格：</strong>€5-20</p>\n      <p><strong>特色：</strong>创新酿造</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;spumante-section\\&quot;\">\n    <h3>🥂 Aglianico Spumante 气泡酒新趋势</h3>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;spumante-grid\\&quot;\">\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;spumante-card\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>Metodo Classico 传统法</h4>\n        <p><strong>工艺：</strong>瓶中二次发酵</p>\n        <p><strong>陈年：</strong>18-36个月酒泥接触</p>\n        <p><strong>风格：</strong>复杂、细腻、高酸</p>\n        <p><strong>价格：</strong>€25-45</p>\n        <p><strong>代表：</strong>Paternoster Rosé Brut</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;spumante-card\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>Metodo Charmat 罐中法</h4>\n        <p><strong>工艺：</strong>不锈钢罐二次发酵</p>\n        <p><strong>陈年：</strong>3-6个月</p>\n        <p><strong>风格：</strong>果香明显、清新</p>\n        <p><strong>价格：</strong>€12-22</p>\n        <p><strong>代表：</strong>入门级Aglianico气泡</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
