      "title": "🏆 传奇名庄巡礼（精华版）",
      "content": "<div class=\"\\&quot;winery-grid\\&quot;\">\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-card\" elena\\\"=\"\">\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-header\\&quot;\">\n        <h3>Elena Fucci</h3>\n        <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-subtitle\\&quot;\">女性酿酒师传奇 | The Queen of Vulture</div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>创立：</strong>2000年（Elena 25岁接手家族）\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>规模：</strong>8公顷 | 30,000瓶/年（精品小产）\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>海拔：</strong>550-600m 黄金区间\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>特色：</strong>单一园Titolo、极简主义酿造\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;flagship-wine\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>🍷 旗舰酒：Titolo</h4>\n        <p><span class=\"\\&quot;parker-badge\\&quot;\">Parker 95分</span>（2005年震撼世界）</p>\n        <p><strong>价格：</strong>€70-90（配额制，极难买）</p>\n        <p><strong>风格：</strong>优雅、精致、极致矿物感</p>\n        <p><strong>陈年：</strong>20-30年</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;visit-info\\&quot;\">\n        <p>🚗 <strong>参访：</strong>€35/人 | 需提前2-3周预订</p>\n        <p>👩 <strong>亮点：</strong>30%机率Elena亲自接待</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-card\" paternoster\\\"=\"\">\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-header\\&quot;\">\n        <h3>Paternoster</h3>\n        <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-subtitle\\&quot;\">百年标竿 | Vulture复兴先驱</div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>创立：</strong>1925年（近百年历史）\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>规模：</strong>22公顷 | 150,000瓶/年\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>转折：</strong>1990年代现代化改革\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>特色：</strong>传统与现代完美平衡\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;flagship-wine\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>🍷 旗舰酒：Don Anselmo</h4>\n        <p><span class=\"\\&quot;parker-badge\\&quot;\">Parker 92分</span>（1997 首次90+）</p>\n        <p><strong>价格：</strong>€60-80</p>\n        <p><strong>风格：</strong>强劲、复杂、陈年潜力强</p>\n        <p><strong>陈年：</strong>24个月橡木桶</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;visit-info\\&quot;\">\n        <p>🚗 <strong>参访：</strong>€25/人 | 容易预订</p>\n        <p>🏛️ <strong>亮点：</strong>16世纪历史酒窖参观</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-card\" notaio\\\"=\"\">\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-header\\&quot;\">\n        <h3>Cantine del Notaio</h3>\n        <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-subtitle\\&quot;\">律师转行传奇 | 现代化标竿</div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>创立：</strong>1998年（律师Gerardo Giuratrabocchetti）\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>规模：</strong>35公顷 | 250,000瓶/年（Vulture最大精品）\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>海拔：</strong>500-650m 垂直布局\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>特色：</strong>现代化酿造、多款单一园\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;flagship-wine\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>🍷 旗舰酒：Il Repertorio</h4>\n        <p><span class=\"\\&quot;parker-badge\\&quot;\">Parker 93-95分</span></p>\n        <p><strong>价格：</strong>€65-75</p>\n        <p><strong>风格：</strong>浓郁、饱满、国际化</p>\n        <p><strong>陈年：</strong>18个月法国橡木桶</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;visit-info\\&quot;\">\n        <p>🚗 <strong>参访：</strong>€20/人 | 很容易预订</p>\n        <p>🏗️ <strong>亮点：</strong>现代化建筑+葡萄园景观</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-card\" dangelo\\\"=\"\">\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-header\\&quot;\">\n        <h3>D'Angelo</h3>\n        <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-subtitle\\&quot;\">传统守护者 | 风土纯粹主义</div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>创立：</strong>1939年（第三代传承）\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>规模：</strong>40公顷 | 200,000瓶/年\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>贡献：</strong>1990年代现代化先驱\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>特色：</strong>大橡木桶、传统风土表达\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;flagship-wine\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>🍷 旗舰酒：Vigna Caselle</h4>\n        <p><span class=\"\\&quot;parker-badge\\&quot;\">Parker 90-92分</span></p>\n        <p><strong>价格：</strong>€45-60</p>\n        <p><strong>风格：</strong>传统、优雅、风土驱动</p>\n        <p><strong>陈年：</strong>大橡木桶（Botti grandi）</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;visit-info\\&quot;\">\n        <p>🚗 <strong>参访：</strong>€20/人 | 容易预订</p>\n        <p>🍷 <strong>亮点：</strong>传统酿造工艺展示</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;comparison-table-section\\&quot;\">\n    <h3>📊 4大酒庄快速对比表</h3>\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;winery-comparison-table\\&quot;\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>维度</th>\n            <th>Elena Fucci</th>\n            <th>Paternoster</th>\n            <th>Cantine del Notaio</th>\n            <th>D'Angelo</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🎯 市场定位</td>\n            <td>超精品膜拜酒</td>\n            <td>经典标竿</td>\n            <td>现代精品</td>\n            <td>传统代表</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🍷 酿造风格</td>\n            <td>极简、优雅</td>\n            <td>传统+现代</td>\n            <td>现代、国际化</td>\n            <td>传统、风土</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🪵 橡木桶</td>\n            <td>法国小桶12月</td>\n            <td>法国+斯拉夫尼亚</td>\n            <td>法国新桶18月</td>\n            <td>大橡木桶24月</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>💰 旗舰酒价格</td>\n            <td>€70-90</td>\n            <td>€60-80</td>\n            <td>€65-75</td>\n            <td>€45-60</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>⭐ Parker分数</td>\n            <td>94-97分</td>\n            <td>91-93分</td>\n            <td>92-95分</td>\n            <td>90-92分</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>⏳ 陈年潜力</td>\n            <td>20-30年</td>\n            <td>20-25年</td>\n            <td>15-25年</td>\n            <td>15-20年</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🔥 稀缺度</td>\n            <td>极高（配额制）</td>\n            <td>中等</td>\n            <td>普通</td>\n            <td>普通</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🏆 性价比</td>\n            <td>★★★☆☆</td>\n            <td>★★★★☆</td>\n            <td>★★★★☆</td>\n            <td>★★★★★</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🚗 参访价值</td>\n            <td>★★★★★ 必去</td>\n            <td>★★★★★ 强推</td>\n            <td>★★★★☆ 推荐</td>\n            <td>★★★★☆ 推荐</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>🎯 推荐人群</td>\n            <td>收藏家、极客</td>\n            <td>经典爱好者</td>\n            <td>现代风格偏好</td>\n            <td>传统风格偏好</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
