      "type": "content",
      "title": "🍽️ 配餐指南 + 🗺️ 葡萄酒旅游完整攻略",
      "content": "<div class=\"\\&quot;section-title\\&quot;\">Part A: 配餐指南 - 4种风格场景</div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-grid\\&quot;\">\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-card\" young\\\"=\"\">\n      <h3>🍕 年轻DOC €10-20</h3>\n      \n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>🍷 酒款特性：</strong>\n        果香明显、单宁柔和、易饮亲人\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>🍽️ 配餐推荐：</strong>\n        <div class=\"\\&quot;food-tags\\&quot;\">\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Pizza Margherita</span>\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Pasta al Ragu</span>\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Parmigiana茄子千层</span>\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Lasagna</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>🌡️ 侍酒温度：</strong>16-18°C（略微冰镇）\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>⏱️ 醒酒时间：</strong>30分钟-1小时\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-card\" superiore\\\"=\"\">\n      <h3>🥩 DOCG Superiore €25-40</h3>\n      \n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>🍷 酒款特性：</strong>\n        结构完整、单宁扎实、复杂度中高\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>🍽️ 配餐推荐：</strong>\n        <div class=\"\\&quot;food-tags\\&quot;\">\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Agnello烤羊肉</span>\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Brasato红酒炖牛肉</span>\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Ossobuco米兰牛膝</span>\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">陈年Pecorino</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>🌡️ 侍酒温度：</strong>18-20°C（室温）\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>⏱️ 醒酒时间：</strong>1-2小时\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-card\" riserva\\\"=\"\">\n      <h3>🦌 DOCG Riserva €40-80</h3>\n      \n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>🍷 酒款特性：</strong>\n        陈年佳作、极致复杂、矿物感强\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>🍽️ 配餐推荐：</strong>\n        <div class=\"\\&quot;food-tags\\&quot;\">\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Cinghiale野猪炖</span>\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Tartufo Nero松露宽面</span>\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Porcini牛肝菌烩饭</span>\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Venison鹿肉</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>🌡️ 侍酒温度：</strong>18-19°C（精准控温）\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>⏱️ 醒酒时间：</strong>2-3小时（建议用醒酒器）\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-card\" collector\\\"=\"\">\n      <h3>⭐ 收藏级Titolo €80-100</h3>\n      \n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>🍷 酒款特性：</strong>\n        顶级膜拜酒、极致优雅、独一无二\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>🍽️ 配餐推荐：</strong>\n        <div class=\"\\&quot;food-tags\\&quot;\">\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Filetto松露牛菲力</span>\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Foie Gras鹅肝</span>\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Wagyu A5和牛</span>\n          <span class=\"\\&quot;food-tag\\&quot;\">Or Alone单独品鉴</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>🌡️ 侍酒温度：</strong>18°C（恒温柜）\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;pairing-info\\&quot;\">\n        <strong>⏱️ 醒酒时间：</strong>2-4小时（年轻酒款）或1小时（陈年酒）\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;section-title\\&quot;\">Part B: 葡萄酒旅游路线</div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;tour-section\\&quot;\">\n    <div class=