t-size:=\"\" 0.9em;=\"\" color:=\"\" #7f8c8d;\\\"=\"\">\n          含3天深度体验、所有门票、餐饮、住宿\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"\\&quot;practical-info\\&quot;\">\n    <h3>🧳 旅游实用资讯</h3>\n    \n    <div class=\"\\&quot;info-grid\\&quot;\">\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;info-item\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>📅 最佳季节</h4>\n        <p><strong>9-10月</strong>采收季</p>\n        <p>气候宜人</p>\n        <p>可参与采收</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;info-item\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>✈️ 交通方式</h4>\n        <p><strong>Bari机场</strong>1.5h</p>\n        <p>Naples机场2h</p>\n        <p>必须租车</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;info-item\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>🚗 租车费用</h4>\n        <p><strong>€40-60/天</strong></p>\n        <p>山区道路多</p>\n        <p>GPS必备</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;info-item\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>💬 语言</h4>\n        <p><strong>意大利语</strong>为主</p>\n        <p>英语普及率低</p>\n        <p>翻译App必备</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;info-item\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>🍷 购酒运输</h4>\n        <p><strong>DHL €80-150</strong></p>\n        <p>12瓶装箱</p>\n        <p>酒庄代寄</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;info-item\\&quot;\">\n        <h4>📱 预订建议</h4>\n        <p><strong>提前2-4周</strong></p>\n        <p>Elena Fucci需1月前</p>\n        <p>邮件预订</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"\\&quot;checklist\\&quot;\">\n      <h4>✓ 行前准备清单</h4>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;checklist-item\\&quot;\">提前预订酒庄参访（Elena Fucci至少1个月）</div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;checklist-item\\&quot;\">租车含GPS和全险（山区道路曲折）</div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;checklist-item\\&quot;\">下载离线地图和翻译App</div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;checklist-item\\&quot;\">准备现金（小酒庄多不接受信用卡）</div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;checklist-item\\&quot;\">轻便行李（方便携带购买葡萄酒）</div>\n      <div class=\"\\&quot;checklist-item\\&quot;\">购买旅游保险（山区驾驶风险）</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
